  "title": "Raisin Pumpkin Bread Gluten Free",
  "description": "Eating gluten-free doesn't mean you can't have a raisin and pumpkin quick bread, thanks to this recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie Power Bergeron"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:10:37-05:00",
